  _questDescription: "H\xECnh l\u1EADp ph\u01B0\u01A1ng c\xF3 c\xE1c m\u1EB7t: A-M\u1EB7t
    tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, B-M\u1EB7t ph\u1EA3i, C-M\u1EB7t sau, D-M\u1EB7t tr\xE1i, E-M\u1EB7t
    tr\xEAn, F-M\u1EB7t d\u01B0\u1EDBi. N\u1EBFu xoay h\xECnh l\u1EADp ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
    90\xB0 quanh tr\u1EE5c th\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1EE9ng (qua E v\xE0 F) theo chi\u1EC1u
    kim \u0111\u1ED3ng h\u1ED3 nh\xECn t\u1EEB tr\xEAn xu\u1ED1ng, m\u1EB7t n\xE0o
    s\u1EBD chuy\u1EC3n ra ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc?\n            E\n            |\n       
    +-----+\n    D |        | B\n        |   A   |\n        +-----+\n           
    F\n\nA. M\u1EB7t ph\u1EA3i (B)\nB. M\u1EB7t sau (C)\nC. M\u1EB7t tr\xE1i (D)\nD.
    M\u1EB7t tr\u01B0\u1EDBc (A)"
